type: icon-list
title: Platform Features

- 🔒 Encryption: End-to-end encrypted at rest and in transit with zero-knowledge key management
- ⚡ Performance: Sub-100ms API response times globally via edge caching and connection pooling
- 📊 Analytics: Real-time insights with custom dashboards and automated anomaly detection
- 🌍 Multi-region: Global failover across five regions with automatic traffic rerouting
